# Real build output (mise run ui-build) lands in internal/webui/dist since
# go:embed paths are relative to the embedding package — never committed;
# index.html is kept as a tracked placeholder so `go:embed` always has at
# least one file on a fresh clone, before the UI has been built.
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/index.html
